{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","布鲁特斯"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名英勇的战士，善于冲锋陷阵。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","让敌人颤抖吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","For the god of war!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","蛮血必将辉煌！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","The Maulers will inevitably gain glory."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","狂刃——风暴！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Frenzied blade! Storm!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","继续……进攻！！"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Keep going... attack!"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","杰出的胜利，各位，棒极了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","A great victory, the glory of which belongs to each and every warrior."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","无论何种战场，我都将全力以赴"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","好，准备结束！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","状态不错老伙计！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","蛮血必胜。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","用心的礼物，多谢。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","好，我收下了。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","蛮血战神"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","战争永远只是战争。即使身为战神。正因身为战神。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","破敌锋刃"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","他永远身先士卒。从未退却，从未恐惧，从未败北。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","完成剧情任务“残阳武斗场（下）”特定环节获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","是个休息的好地方"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","好久没这样休息了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","给我来一杯吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","外面下雪了啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","到隆冬节了啊……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","真是热闹啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要去看他们比武吗？"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯力大无穷，能够用常人无法举起的巨剑使出精妙的剑法。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","据说布鲁特斯的巨剑是上古时代的灵器，除了自己选择的主人外，无人能将其举起。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","蛮血生性好战，但鲜少有人敢于直接挑战布鲁特斯。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","“那不是敌人的血！只是一种辛辣的红汤。”布鲁特斯本人如此回应关于他日常饮食的谣言。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","“当时那柄巨剑已经横在我的脖子上了，可是他却说——点到为止。”输给布鲁特斯的挑战者如是说。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","即使是空中的一片羽毛，布鲁特斯也能准确的用那柄巨剑劈成两半。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯嗜辣，尤其喜爱一种形似兽牙的辣椒，众多人挑战这种调料之后都对布鲁特斯多了分佩服。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯不拘小节，身着华服、编上发辫时会有些不自在。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","据说，布鲁特斯曾将值得尊敬的对手的盔甲碎片埋在一座高山之巅，从此再未踏足。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","“他的胸怀宽广，这比实力更可贵。”克鲁格在看过兄长决斗落败却保住性命后，如此评价布鲁特斯。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","刚成为蛮血战神时，我的确沉浸在喜悦之中。而那份喜悦却是战神头衔唯一的褒奖……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411080.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","难得看到布鲁特斯大人在这里休息！"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411170.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","你就是他们说的战神，布鲁特斯？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415705.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","那非 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","这里加一点红色……这里的地面上，再加上很多红色的花！"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415017.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","噜噜 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","呀呼！非常荣幸见到您，伟大的蛮血战神！"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415036.json"],["